Now there's no more stare button.

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:49.060
Yeah, there's no more stare button, right?

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:56.400
That's amazing. And there's no more, you can get on a ship and sail the seas to get to other parts of the world, right?

00:03:56.560 --> 00:03:58.380
Instead of just traveling on land.

00:03:58.520 --> 00:03:59.780
But there was a ship.

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:00.820
There was a ship.

