00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:26.620
This is going to be a tough thing to discuss because there's so many different angles you can go at it.

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:33.480
I feel like we just have to give it like our shake, our original take on Dragon Warrior 2

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:40.560
without trying to keep saying, well, Final Fantasy did this or this is better because Dragon Warrior 1 didn't do this.

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:47.220
Like, let's not give it any handicaps, but let's also not try to beat it up so much.

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:53.120
