00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:54.640
So we're doing good cop, bad cop?

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:55.980
Yeah, yeah.

00:04:56.700 --> 00:05:02.440
Well, the first thing I wanted to point out, holy original take here, not really Dragon Warrior 2.

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:06.600
And it's not like a Dragon Quest 2 gotcha moment.

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:09.360
Okay. It says on the title screen, part 2.

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:10.760
Dragon Warrior part 2, yes.

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:11.800
This is part 2.

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:16.040
This is not like, you know, oh, you don't need to play whatever.

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:19.140
Like, you don't need to play the original to know this.

