But this is a little different than Final Fantasy 1 and Final Fantasy 2.

00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:31.200
This one is saying it is a continuation of the story of the original Dragon Warrior right on the title screen.

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:37.660
This is all semantics, though, because everything, like, Final Fantasy, like, yeah, they're an anthology series.

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:39.300
We shouldn't know that yet.

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:51.920
But a part 2 in this is like any other 2 in media where it's you, you are in the same world playing a different character or maybe similar.

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:53.960
Maybe they're related. Like, this is a 2.

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:55.460
It's just called part 2.

00:05:55.940 --> 00:06:05.300
So isn't it funny then that, like, RPGs are kind of, like, stepping away from being like, oh, and you're going to be Erdrick again.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:08.560
