Like, what, it's basically, you may as well end.

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:29.040
Right, so he's looking for, like, a new game plus afterwards.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:34.240
Yes. Yeah, okay. So, we're the hero here, uh, a descendant of Erdrick.

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:41.700
