00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:37.600
Mm-hmm.

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:08.400
Um, go get him.

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:16.940
Like, you end up happening upon him, basically, when you're trying to, like, reset yourself and be like, where should I check next?

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.000
