00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:34.480
Yeah, and I actually, I find that, like, to have some comedy element to it as well, where, like, you, to your point, you basically do have to go in a full circle just to find the guy that, like, he's obviously wouldn't just be there if you left the town and came back, but you have to go to all the other places in order to track him down.

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:46.340
And then there's another, like, funny thing with the princess where there's, uh, I forget what the name of the town is, but there's a dog in that town, and the dog will follow you if you don't have the key item yet.

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:50.820
