00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:00.100
Like, let's go.

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:08.720
That's also another, like, fun, uh, not necessarily puzzly, but indirect way of having somebody join your party.

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:20.940
I do like this first act in terms of building on the story of the first game, where in the first game you were essentially just, I am, I am at this town, and to get to the next town, I need to be this level.

